3.7 Confidence Score Module
File: confidence.py

Calculates a comprehensive confidence score for each tax code recommendation using multiple weighted factors.

Confidence Score Formula:

Final Score = (w_score × similarity_score) + (w_param × param_match) + (w_freq × frequency_score) + (w_recency × recency_score)
Score Components:

Component	Weight (Default)	Description
similarity_score	0.45	Vector similarity score from Azure AI Search (0-1)
param_match	0.25	1 if corresponding parameters match, 0 otherwise
frequency_score	0.20	How often this tax code appears in historical data
recency_score	0.10	Exponential decay based on date difference
Recency Calculation:

recency = exp(-k_r × days_gap)
Where k_r is the recency coefficient (default: 0.05)

